      "use": "Typical recoil permeability near 1.05 sintered and 1.1..1.7 isotropic bonded NdFeB; chosen local ranges are 1.03..1.07 and 1.10..1.30."
    },
    {
      "url": "https://mqitechnology.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/mqp-b-20441-070.pdf",
      "use": "Generic bonded NdFeB family; finished-ring Br also depends on binder loading and magnetization."
